            <ArticleTitle>[Serious adverse effects of blood collection].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>301-5</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1016/j.tracli.2010.09.164</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The notification of serious adverse events occurring resulting from the collection of blood or blood components is a statutory requirement. The value of this set of surveillance procedures is the use of data collected. This article focuses on the organization of the French notification system, and the management of the main side effects known and reported.</AbstractText>
